OL,3,GNEWSACourt fight looms over playing
OL,4,Afields school plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have said they are "not
OL,7,Fbacking down" in their fight to stop a
OL,8,Fschool being built on a recreation
OL,9,Fspace.
OL,11,FKent County Council (KCC) has long
OL,12,Fearmarked the playing fields at Church
OL,13,FStreet, Whitstable, for a new school
OL,14,Ffor children with special educational
OL,15,Fneeds and disabilities which would be
OL,16,Fbuilt by the Department for Education.
OL,18,FFriends of Church Street Playing Fields
OL,19,Fapplied for village green status to
OL,20,Fprevent development of the land.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
