OL,3,GNEWSACourt fight looms over playing
OL,4,Afields school plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors on KCC's planning committee
OL,7,Fupheld a planning inspector's
OL,8,Frecommendation to deny the village
OL,9,Fgreen application. Campaigners said
OL,10,Fthey would seek a judicial review in
OL,11,Fthe High Court.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
